    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>護甲（盾牌），非普通（需同調）</em><br />着裝這面盾牌期間，你的AC具有+1加值。這一加值可與盾牌的普通AC加值疊加。<br /><strong>詛咒Cursed。</strong>這件物品被詛咒了。與其同調時，其上方的詛咒會蔓延至你的身上，直至一次法術<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.ewDH2w8w2yLSM021]{移除詛咒 Remove Curse}</em>或類似法術被施展到了你的身上爲止。詛咒期間，你無法卸下這面盾牌，也無法解除與之的同調。此外，你的行動變得無比遲緩，導致你的速度減半；你在投擲先攻的d20時永遠視爲骰出了1，且你無法以任何方式改變你的先攻結果。</p><p>While you are wielding this shield, you gain a +1 bonus to AC. This bonus is in addition to the shield's normal bonus to AC.</p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Curse\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Curse.</span> This item is cursed. Attuning to it extends the curse to you until you are targeted by a @spell[Remove Curse] spell or similar magic. You cannot discard the shield, and remain attuned to it, as long as you are cursed. As long as you are cursed, you are sluggish. Your speed is halved. When you roll initiative, treat the roll on your [[/r d20]] as a 1. You can't change your initiative by any means.</p></div></div>",
